. do dofiles/05_stata-advanced-extra.do 

. *==========================================================*
. * DEMO 5/5 : stata-advanced（补充）—— 多层模型与 IRT（书第 15–16 章）
. * 说明     : 这两个方法需要纵向数据 / 条目数据，auto.dta 不具备该结构，
. *            故改用本仓库自带配套数据 data/agis6/。
. * 技能源   : stata-advanced/SKILL.md
. *==========================================================*
. version 19.5

. set more off

. clear all

. 
. *---- 第 15 章：多层（混合）模型 --------------------------
. use "../data/agis6/longitudinal_mixed.dta", clear

. clonevar drink0 = drink98
(1,237 missing values generated)

. clonevar drink2 = drink00
(1,018 missing values generated)

. clonevar drink4 = drink02
(814 missing values generated)

. clonevar drink6 = drink04
(795 missing values generated)

. clonevar drink8 = drink06
(634 missing values generated)

. clonevar drink10 = drink08
(654 missing values generated)

. drop drink98 drink00 drink02 drink04 drink06 drink08

. reshape long drink, i(id) j(wave)
(j = 0 2 4 6 8 10)

Data                               Wide   ->   Long
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Number of observations            1,771   ->   10,626      
Number of variables                   8   ->   4           
j variable (6 values)                     ->   wave
xij variables:
              drink0 drink2 ... drink10   ->   drink
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

. 
